+  // shift of the incident face by rounding or by a small real drift makes the clip emit an intersection part way along
+  // each such edge. It lies on the polygon's edge, adds nothing to the support polygon, and becomes one more contact at
+  // the corners' depth, so the face's contacts go from 4 to 6 or 8 and back from step to step, and with them the force
+  // the face carries. A vertex is dropped when the sine of the turn of the polygon's boundary at it is below the noise
